From: buntOS contributors
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: dt-bindings: add MediaTek MT6897 AFE and sound card

The AFE of MT6897 is the block of MT8196 with its own clock tree: the
audio clocks come from topckgen, not from the VLP domain, and the ADSP
bus clock is not involved. The sound card binds the AFE to the amplifiers
on the TDM link, and later to the PMIC codec.
---
 .../bindings/sound/mediatek,mt6897-afe.yaml   | 112 ++++++++++++++++++
 .../sound/mediatek,mt6897-mt6368.yaml         |  99 ++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 211 insertions(+)
